{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年34歲的前TVB新聞主播梁凱寧（Maggie），自2019年離巢後積極發展多元事業，身兼言語治療師及節目主持之餘亦勤力經營社交平台。近日，她趁空檔飛赴韓國旅行並大派福利，除了與老公甜蜜放閃外，更以多套秋裝及傳統韓服上陣，大晒「逆天長腿」與誘人黑絲，吸睛度爆燈。</p><figure><img alt=\"梁凱寧到韓國首爾旅行。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495988651560960283796.jpeg/XG0Hgs08lZQREUcm732qVn4ZXdioB7bZkPb3_5D29_8\"/><figcaption>梁凱寧到韓國首爾旅行。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><p>風衣配黑絲大騷長腿</p><p>遊走首爾潮區街頭期間，梁凱寧換上卡其色高領雙排扣短身風衣，腰間繫上同色腰帶盡顯纖細腰線，下身則以黑色短褲配搭黑色長靴，大玩黑絲誘惑，期間更擺出多個型格姿勢，大騷美腿之餘，還展示性感「絕對領域」，非常吸引；而另外一張鏡前合照，則見她緊緊挽着另一半手臂依偎放閃，雖然老公僅以背影出鏡，但依然甜度滿瀉。</p><figure><img alt=\"短款風衣配上黑絲。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495984213725184418306.jpeg/pTpqO_s0DpNklifzNglNWE3PB30skGDc1uFq3tbhat4\"/><figcaption>短款風衣配上黑絲。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓味十足。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495982175162368213458.jpeg/p3DgZRKJ7MpV9m8K1vX9PTlXuyHGtP3C6nDfiupw34o\"/><figcaption>韓味十足。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"到復古電話亭打卡。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495979847192576765140.jpeg/dEH7ZjHWuPTtj0VjOsHPgXxPsljIxdo8QBMHcEATB3A\"/><figcaption>到復古電話亭打卡。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與老公甜蜜放閃。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495990417362944615329.jpeg/lQhgQKDsy2Bn1lye4eonE-n_4rdJI1CGCqqcXAqqnFw\"/><figcaption>與老公甜蜜放閃。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><p>日夜造型大玩氣質反差</p><p>除了型格性感的街頭穿搭，梁凱寧亦入鄉隨俗大玩日夜反差。日間她改穿淡雅的米白色企領長褸配卡其色長靴，現身佈滿金黃銀杏樹的公園打卡，行走間大褸微開不經意露出白滑美腿；入夜後她更特地體驗韓國傳統服飾，換上一襲粉白漸變的精緻韓服並襯上古典花飾，在夜間街頭留影，展現與之前截然不同的溫婉氣質。</p><figure><img alt=\"米白色長風衣上陣。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495988219416576672138.jpeg/BYMMHVzKbYPAo-ovFVCV-neC_AxtDuapxOGIo8ThiKM\"/><figcaption>米白色長風衣上陣。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"露白滑美腿。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495985904029696735918.jpeg/aLyxr6mVRclB22KBDM91TAOKJ0qw7H5O05oCbdOaAm0\"/><figcaption>露白滑美腿。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"體驗韓國傳統服飾。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495983752220672861370.jpeg/xYVRyG4hy6k1OoDj0kOF6ZPCi4Ew3zP1L2U0pS9lNKU\"/><figcaption>體驗韓國傳統服飾。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"夜間到首爾街頭拍韓服照。（IG@maggieleung0722）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197495981277450240198642.jpeg/YXNaj5zh8Ae-d_GVbuzixEvNmn3NcgDwp6P4zaej-M0\"/><figcaption>夜間到首爾街頭拍韓服照。（IG@maggieleung0722）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:43:57.429499+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":711,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:30:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:27.556587+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:37:29.515758+00:00","content_hash":"65d72366fee6e6af7fa06bd36c8be57a4d631ed464e6a127212ec2dcd86c9a84","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}